# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots the demo app (with vulnerable Log4j 2.15.0) in the
# background and execs `sleep infinity`, so the daemon is already running when
# the agent starts (making the "swapped the jars but never restarted" case
# detectable) and PID 1 stays `sleep infinity`. Solutions must RESTART the app
# after upgrading Log4j.
